WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:04.938
One of the coolest places in CMU is TechSpark,
located in Hammerschlag Hall.

2
00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:09.476
In this area there are a lot of different
machines used in various different activities,

3
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:13.046
such as glassblowing,
welding and 3D printing.

4
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.483
I took a class here
one time called Intro to Modern Making,

5
00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.885
where I was able to learn
how to use different machines

6
00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:21.888
such as the laser engraver
as well as a 3D printer.

7
00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:25.458
As part of this class,
we were able to create a final project

8
00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:29.763
of a prototype of a project that we wanted
to see implemented in real life.

9
00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:34.334
My project was privacy
glasses, which, when wearing,

10
00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.337
allowed the user to go undetected
by security cameras.

11
00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.440
It was really exciting
to see how I came into this class,

12
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.877
not knowing how these machines
even worked, to being able

13
00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:47.013
to comfortably use this to create
something that was uniquely my own.

